    "text": "WBKO\nwebsite\nBowling Green\nMan charged with murder in fatal hit-and-run on near Brandywood Court\nBy Gabrielle Bunton,\n6 hours agoBOWLING GREEN, Ky. (WBKO) - Bowling Green Police released new details on a fatal hit-and-run that left one person dead. On Sunday, Aug 24, Bowling Green Police responded to Brandywood Court for a hit and run investigation. The investigation reveals that Fred Hart, 58, and Mario Haris, 38, both of Bowling Green, had gotten into a verbal altercation.",
